{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsentDropReport","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers17ConsentDropReportO"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports wait until they are read. A record dropped for room is reported as it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dropped; while that report waits unread, later ones merge into it, one report counting","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them all across their timestamps. So the reports waiting unread hold at most one overflow","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"report between any two others (denials and finished trackers), however many events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"overflow. The sequence has one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consumer, and ends once the consent is gone.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"A report of each drop of held or recovered records, in the order they happen.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/dropreports"]}],"section